        "message": "build(studio): scripted macOS release app with bundled native proofing libraries\n\ntool/build_macos_app.sh builds the pinned Hunspell, Arabic morphology,\nCLD3 language-ID and Harper libraries, runs flutter build macos --release,\ninstalls the receipt-verified libraries into Contents/Frameworks and their\nnotices into Contents/Resources, normalizes Harper's install name to @rpath,\nre-signs ad hoc with Release.entitlements and verifies the signature, the\nload commands and that each library opens from the bundle.\n\ntest/studio_macos_bundle_native_gate.dart (explicit gate, not auto-discovered)\nboots Studio with the in-bundle libraries and data installed by the real\ninstallers and checks a mixed Arabic/German/English document: Arabic rules,\nAyaSpell, morphology rules (jussive, numeral gender), German spelling routed\nby detection, Harper, the Detected display and Apply detected language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
